\subtree[2025-05-23]{
\mdnote{2025-05-23}{\tags{#ocaml #os #rust #tla}
- [Why I love OCaml](https://mccd.space/posts/ocaml-the-worlds-best/)
- [How to Get Your Research Paper Accepted](https://maxwellforbes.com/posts/how-to-get-a-paper-accepted)
